I sit down on the sofa with my phone.
I usually take care of that sort of thing in the evening.
I open the website for my electricity provider.
Hopefully it will not take too long.
First, I must log in to my account.
I click on the menu and choose "update profile".
A digital form is shown on the screen.
I read the instructions carefully.
"All required fields must be filled out," it says at the top.
"Changes are saved automatically," the text continues.
I scroll down to the field for contact information.
I type in my new Danish number.
I say the numbers out loud to myself to be sure.
"Twelve, thirty-four, fifty-six, seventy-eight."
I check the numbers on the screen one more time.
Everything looks correct, so I press approve.
